==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|al}}, from {{inh|de|goh|al}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*all}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*allaz}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/al/}}
